polarity-blend.csv.gz — provenance & license
=============================================

A DERIVED high-accuracy POS/NEG polarity lexicon, not part of the frozen 2016
KOSAC release. It is the union (entry-wise absolute-count sum) of:

  1. the frozen KOSAC polarity seeds (POS/NEG columns), counts scaled ×20, and
  2. a lexicon learned from the NSMC training split (Naver Sentiment Movie
     Corpus, ratings_train.txt), keeping morpheme n-grams with frequency >= 5.

Regenerate with:  python -m benchmarks.build_shipped_blend
The stronger full version (frequency >= 2):  ... --full

License: CC BY-SA 4.0. The KOSAC seeds are CC BY-SA 4.0 (see data/LICENSE); NSMC
is CC0. Mixing CC BY-SA with CC0 yields a CC BY-SA work, so this derived file —
and anything redistributing it — is CC BY-SA 4.0. Attribution: KOSAC (Seoul
